1
00:00:00,438 --> 00:00:03,388
Every student founder knows this feeling.

2
00:00:03,462 --> 00:00:08,275
Deadlines in one app, notes in
another, and ideas everywhere.

3
00:00:08,325 --> 00:00:10,700
Important work slips through the cracks.

4
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:13,638
NEXUS brings it all together.

5
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:16,548
The Command Center ranks what
needs your attention next,

6
00:00:16,588 --> 00:00:19,612
and every score shows exactly why.

7
00:00:20,333 --> 00:00:24,833
NEXUS checks your deadlines and
workload, and flags risks early.

8
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:29,800
Then the planner finds real free
time in your week to get it done.

9
00:00:31,088 --> 00:00:33,250
Need something done? Just ask.

10
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:37,775
NEXUS uses its own trained AI
model to understand your request,

11
00:00:37,850 --> 00:00:41,600
shows you what it understood,
and acts only when you confirm.

12
00:00:42,333 --> 00:00:45,983
And every note and meeting
is one keystroke away.

13
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:50,875
Because it runs on your own
machine, your data stays yours.

14
00:00:50,925 --> 00:00:53,635
NEXUS. Less juggling, more doing.

15
00:00:53,675 --> 00:00:55,137
Come and explore it.

